All correspondance regarding SCEC CVM-H should be directed to software@scec.org.
Any scientific questions regarding this model should be directed to the 
researchers behind this model.

Andreas Plesch <andreas_plesch@harvard.edu>
Carl Tape <carltape@fas.harvard.edu>
John Shaw <shaw@eps.harvard.edu>
Patrick Small <patrices@usc.edu>
David Gill <davidgil@usc.edu>

The data and code for this model is based off of the following paper:

Shaw, J. H., et al. (2015), Unified structural representation of the southern 
      California crust and upper mantle, Earth Planet. Sci. Lett., 415, 1–15,
      doi:10.1016/j.epsl.2015.01.016
